        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wastewater treatment plant, class 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wastewater treatment plant, class 4
For municipal wastewater treatment plant capacity class 4 with an average per-captia equivalent PCE (Einwohnergleichwert) of 5321 and an average annual sewage volume of 1.07 million m3/a. A lifetime of 30 years is assumed.;
Synonyms: municipal WWTP infrastructure capacity class 4; 
UUID: 5c5f06b7-6e4d-3b92-81ec-2fbbe7cf9f56
Infrastructure materials for municipal wastewater treatment plant, transports, dismantling. Land use burdens.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Three stage wastewater treatment (mechanical, biological, chemical) including sludge digestion (fermentation) according to the average technology in Switzerland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c5f06b7-6e4d-3b92-81ec-2fbbe7cf9f56.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
